# Build variant for the Gertec SK-210 totem: the device has a physical
# barcode reader instead of a camera. This forces the app to never touch the
# camera/ML Kit scanner path, relying only on the keyboard-wedge listener
# (see src/features/scanner/KeyboardWedgeScanner.ts) that reads the
# hardware scanner's input.
VITE_SCAN_MODE=hardware
